  "description": "Text detectors often fail to detect real-world scene-texts, <em>e.g.</em>, curved or long texts.\n                 We propose a two-stage approach; first detect individual characters and connect them.\n                 We also introduce semi-weakly-supervised training trick to boost our detector's performance."
